    "detailed_description": "<h1>Supports Valve Index (and Index Controllers)</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/61130e100b738a881608dc0f5adc710f.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/61130e100b738a881608dc0f5adc710f.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/61130e100b738a881608dc0f5adc710f.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Fujii</i> fully supports the Valve Index HMD and the Valve Index Controllers.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Fujii</i> is a meditative and magical journey through dreamlike landscapes filled with light and wonder. <br><br>An adorable gnome companion welcomes you home. It\u2019s the beautiful garden of your dreams, ready to come to life through the mystical power that lies at your fingertips. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Rejuvenate your soul as you affectionately nurture bountiful seeds, solve gentle puzzles, and explore otherworldly biomes eager to surprise and delight you. Take a breath, allow yourself to forget the troubles of the real world, and bask in this serene and uplifting experience about caring and cultivating.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f <u>FEATURES</u> \ud83c\udf3f</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore three organic biomes filled with magic, enchanted flowers, and beautiful plants<br></li><li>Nurture your own unique garden by collecting seeds to harvest colorful landscapes<br></li><li>Introduce gentle critters to your garden and solve puzzles with your adorable gnome companion by your side<br></li><li>Embark on a peaceful and whimsical adventure set to a meditative soundscape composed by French artist and composer Norman Bambi</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/8baf7a1875be45b0e9085995d61eb1b7.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Fujii</i> is a meditative and magical journey through dreamlike landscapes filled with light and wonder. <br><br>An adorable gnome companion welcomes you home. It\u2019s the beautiful garden of your dreams, ready to come to life through the mystical power that lies at your fingertips. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/76fd88d8da0c3a4cea36fa2679565285.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Rejuvenate your soul as you affectionately nurture bountiful seeds, solve gentle puzzles, and explore otherworldly biomes eager to surprise and delight you. Take a breath, allow yourself to forget the troubles of the real world, and bask in this serene and uplifting experience about caring and cultivating.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f <u>FEATURES</u> \ud83c\udf3f</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore three organic biomes filled with magic, enchanted flowers, and beautiful plants<br></li><li>Nurture your own unique garden by collecting seeds to harvest colorful landscapes<br></li><li>Introduce gentle critters to your garden and solve puzzles with your adorable gnome companion by your side<br></li><li>Embark on a peaceful and whimsical adventure set to a meditative soundscape composed by French artist and composer Norman Bambi</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.poster.avif?t=1743532611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.webm?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589040/extras/3402be38f4554e0f6ded41907b984e72.mp4?t=1743532611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Explore a colorful and magical world, lovingly nurture seeds, and introduce gentle critters to the verdant landscape you\u2019ll manifest with your very own hands. A meditative and rejuvenating VR adventure in which you cultivate the garden of your dreams.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt seems like there\u2019s a sounds, visuals, and haptics to everything you do, and it really helps make the world feel real and responsive around you. I can\u2019t think of another game in VR that does this quite as well and as consistently as Fujii.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Ben Lang, Executive Editor - Road to VR<br><br>\u201cFujii is a flower-filled garden of surprises that showcases everything wonderful about VR in a single experience.\u201d<br>Bryan Taylor, Contributing Writer - BigBossBattle (B3)<br>",
